prompt:
You are the Tester agent. The Developer produced these files for
task TASK-005 (Support panel reads service line hours from configuration):

--- index.html ---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MapleSure SponsorConnect</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .container { padding: 20px; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; }
        label { display: block; margin-top: 10px; }
        input, select, textarea, button { width: 100%; padding: 8px; margin-top: 5px; }
        #confirmation { display: none; }
        footer { margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #777; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <form id="claim-form">
        <h1>MapleSure SponsorConnect: Disability Claim Submission</h1>
        <label for="policy-number">Policy Number:</label>
        <input type="text" id="policy-number">

        <label for="member-id">Member ID:</label>
        <input type="text" id="member-id">

        <button type="button" onclick="lookupMember()">Look up member</button>

        <div id="member-details"></div>

        <hr>

        <label for="last-day-worked">Last Day Worked:</label>
        <input type="date" id="last-day-worked">

        <label for="first-day-absent">First Day Absent:</label>
        <input type="date" id="first-day-absent">

        <label for="nature-absence">Nature of Absence:</label>
        <select id="nature-absence">
            <option value="illness">Illness</option>
            <option value="injury">Injury</option>
            <option value="other">Other</option>
        </select>

        <label for="details">Details (if any):</label>
        <textarea id="details"></textarea>

        <label for="documents">Upload supporting documents:</label>
        <input type="file" id="documents" multiple onchange="updateFileList()">

        <ul id="file-list"></ul>

        <button type="submit">Submit Claim</button>
    </form>

    <div id="confirmation">
        <h2>Claim Received</h2>
        <p>Reference Number: <span id="reference-number"></span></p>
        <p>Status: Received</p>
    </div>

    <footer>
        MapleSure Insurance — fictional demo application
    </footer>
</div>
<script>
    const mockMemberData = {
        "123456": { name: "John Doe", policy: "987654" },
        "654321": { name: "Jane Smith", policy: "123987" },
    };

    const config = {
        serviceHours: "Mon-Fri 9am to 5pm",
        helpCenterURL: "https://advisor-help-center.example.com"
    };

    function lookupMember() {
        const memberId = document.getElementById('member-id').value;
        const detailsPanel = document.getElementById('member-details');
        const member = mockMemberData[memberId];
        if (member) {
            detailsPanel.innerHTML = `<p>Name: ${member.name}<br>Policy: ${member.policy}</p>`;
        } else {
            detailsPanel.innerHTML = '<p>Member not found.</p>';
        }
    }

    function updateFileList() {
        const input = document.getElementById('documents');
        const fileList = document.getElementById('file-list');
        fileList.innerHTML = '';
        for (const file of input.files) {
            const li = document.createElement('li');
            li.textContent = file.name;
            fileList.appendChild(li);
        }
    }

    document.getElementById('claim-form').addEventListener('submit', function(event){
        event.preventDefault();
        document.getElementById('claim-form').style.display = 'none';
        document.getElementById('confirmation').style.display = 'block';
        document.getElementById('reference-number').innerText = `MS-2026-08-${Math.floor(Math.random() * 10000).toString().padStart(4, '0')}`;
    });

    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
        // Setup support panel
        const footer = document.querySelector('footer');
        const supportPanel = document.createElement('div');
        supportPanel.innerHTML = `Advisor Service Line Hours: ${config.serviceHours}<br>
            <a href="${config.helpCenterURL}" target="_blank" aria-label="Advisor help center">Advisor Help Center</a>`;
        footer.parentElement.insertBefore(supportPanel, footer);
    });
</script>
</body>
</html>

Acceptance criteria:
- US-5-AC1: Given someone viewing the support panel, when the hours or URL configuration changes, then the panel updates without redeploy.
- US-5-AC2: Given someone viewing the support panel, when checking accessibility, then the panel complies with WCAG 2.1 AA standards.

Write pytest tests (a single test_app.py) that verify the happy path
STRUCTURALLY against the actual file above — read index.html from
Path(__file__).parent and assert what the criteria need: the form and its
required field ids exist, the upload input allows multiple files, the
confirmation panel and status markup exist, the member lookup mock data is
present. 4 to 6 focused tests, stdlib + pytest only, no browser, no server,
no network. Every assertion must hold for the file exactly as shown above,
and must be independent of the current date, time, or environment — never
hard-code a year, month, or timestamp; where the page generates a value at
runtime, assert the generating code exists, not the value it would produce
today.

JSON schema: {"files": [{"path": "test_app.py", "content": str}]}
